\n## Testing\r\n\r\nNo additional test cases added. Manual e2e tests performed on [a test vercel project](https://isr-with-query-i5fzjrhph-epoulter-uclanacuks-projects.vercel.app/one) (note this includes other code from another PR I am working on, but the upshot is that it is a ISR page, which does not 404, as opposed to [an earlier deployment without this fix](https://isr-with-query-4jzt20i06-epoulter-uclanacuks-projects.vercel.app/one) which does 404).\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nNo docs needed as a bug fix for internal adapter logic\r\n","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:02:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T17:12:16Z","closed_at":"2026-03-25T16:40:00Z","merged_at":"2026-03-25T16:40:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"aa266364fe9e105317b66e218fe04567307fb57f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16079/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16079/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/statuses/71ae513388df11d7dad6b1e0077c402ad03d0d62","head":{"label":"empoulter-uclan:vercel-isr-fix","ref":"vercel-isr-fix","sha":"71ae513388df11d7dad6b1e0077c402ad03d0d62","user":{"login":"empoulter-uclan","id":128381217,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6bxIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128381217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan","html_url":"https://github.com/empoulter-uclan","followers_url":"https://